guide forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest
title Elwynn Forest
faction Alliance
race Human
levels 1-13
zone Elwynn Forest
next forever/alliance/02-westfall

# Route: the simulator's consensus route for Human (consensus-alliance-human,
# visits 1 and 3, levels 1 to 12.3). Its visit 2, a Stormwind stop at 6, is
# left out (see "Left out").
#
# Flow: Northshire Valley (Abbey, the kobold camp, Echo Ridge Mine, the
# Defias and Milly's vineyard) -> Goldshire (bind) and Crystal Lake -> the
# south: the Maclure Vineyards, the Fargodeep Mine and the Stonefield farm ->
# Goldshire -> the east: the Tower of Azora, the bridge, Brackwell, Eastvale,
# Stone Cairn Lake, the gnoll camps and the Jasperlode Mine -> Goldshire ->
# the farms and Westbrook -> hearth to Goldshire -> the east again -> the
# road west to Sentinel Hill in Westfall (flight path).
#
# Optional extras: The Big Picture (91752, Shinyfinder Narf is elite) and
# what follows it: Follow That Kobold! (91758), Shhh! We're Hunting Kobolds
# (91772) and Book Return (91775, Nimsy is elite). The Northshire book chain
# runs Nibbled-On Book (91741, a Kobold Vermin drop) -> Book Inventory (92124)
# -> Rascally Rodents (91743) -> Mining Consultant (91745) -> The Big Picture,
# each offered once the one before is done. Rough Wolf Pelts (91751) is for
# skinners: the pelts are skinned. Furlbrow's Deed (184) is optional: the
# Westfall Deed is a rare drop from the Defias; it is turned in in Westfall.
# Croaky's Head (91740) is optional: Croaky, an elite, roams the murloc shore
# south of the bridge where the second east loop takes the Torn Murloc Fins;
# the head goes to Merell Ross at Ridgepoint Tower, a short way east. That
# step's turn-in is plain: the guide stops there only for players who took
# the quest, and passes it for everyone else.
#
# Changes to the simulator's order:
# - The Adventurer (96627) is taken from Marshal McBride with Report to
#   Goldshire and handed to Sam Sarsaparilla before The Great Outdoors: the
#   simulator walked back to Northshire at 10 for it, and the game does not
#   offer the breadcrumb once The Great Outdoors is done.
# - Slimy Menace (99128) is taken from Jason Mathers after A Net Disaster
#   (99127) is handed in, and A Man About a Murloc (99129) after Slimy
#   Menace; Bottles and Baubles (99143) is finished in the murloc camp with
#   Slimy Menace at 6. Baited for Success (99131) is taken from Remy after
#   An Enticing Offer (99130) is handed in, and goes to Jason on the next
#   pass by the lake.
# - The second Delicate Instruments (91724) is taken from Hamish Bergwort
#   after the first (91723) is handed in; its Defias Rogue Wizards are killed
#   at Stone Cairn Lake on the last east pass and it is handed in on the way
#   back to Goldshire.
# - The level 7 walk east to take Hamish Bergwort's quests and hearth back is
#   folded into the east loop at 9: his quests, Blixie Fitzwink's and the
#   Rough Wolf Pelts are done there, and Hamish's and Blixie's are handed in
#   on the way back instead of after the Westbrook trip.
# - A Fishy Peril (40) and Further Concerns (35) are taken in Goldshire after
#   the south loop instead of before it: A Fishy Peril needs level 7, and
#   Further Concerns only leads to Guard Thomas on the east loop.
# - The Gold Pickup Schedule (123) is looted from Gruff Swiftbite on the
#   Westbrook trip at 11 instead of at 8: he is level 12 and walks with the
#   gnolls Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty sends you to. Manhunt (147) moves with it
#   to the last east pass, where Morgan the Collector walks beside the murlocs.
# - Shipment to Stormwind (61) is taken from William Pestle when Kobold
#   Candles is handed in; Morgan Pestle takes it on the Stormwind stop of
#   02-westfall (the simulator took it and never handed it in).
# - An Apple Treat (91738) is done on the Westbrook trip: its Thunder Applejack
#   comes from the Applejack Still (91736) north of the garrison, for four
#   Shiny Red Apples (Wowhead Forever, quest=91736), bought from Homer
#   Stonefield at the Stonefield farm. The still is a short walk off the road.
# - Northshire: Eagan Peltskinner's Wolves Across the Border (33) is taken
#   after Deputy Willem and Marshal McBride (Willem is at the spawn, Eagan at
#   the far corner), and Investigate Echo Ridge (15) right after Kobold Camp
#   Cleanup is handed in to McBride, before the class letters.
# - Eastvale: Sara Timberlain, on the way in, before Hagar Lowe.
#
# Class quests, as class-only steps (the level 10-12 ones from the last
# Goldshire stop, about level 12):
# - Warlock: The Stolen Tome (1598, Summon Imp) in Northshire. Gakin's
#   Summons (1685, Remen Marcot) to Surena Caledon (1688) and The Binding
#   (1689, Summon Voidwalker): a trip to Stormwind and the Brackwell Pumpkin
#   Patch before Westfall.
# - Hunter: A Scribbled Letter (92479) from Marshal McBride to Tordrin
#   Sternblade in Northshire; Josephine Carson's three Taming the Beast
#   quests (94792, 94863, 94864: Tame Beast) and Training the Beast (94793,
#   Isaac Chan: Beast Training), all around Goldshire.
# - Paladin: Tome of Divinity (2998, Brother Wilhelm) through Henze Faulk by
#   Stone Cairn Lake to Redemption (1788): a trip to Stormwind and east
#   Elwynn before Westfall.
# - Priest: Desperate Prayer (5635) and Divine Grace (94774) from Priestess
#   Josetta, handed in at the Cathedral of Light (02-westfall).
#   Forever rewords Desperate Prayer to name High Priest Rohan in Ironforge;
#   the quest data still has Laurena take it, so the route keeps her.
# - Priest: In Favor of the Light / Garments of the Light (5623, 5624) reward
#   a robe, not a spell: not taken.
# - Warrior: the Defensive Stance quests are taken in Stormwind (02-westfall).
# - Mage: Glyphic Letter (3104) in the Abbey. Speak with Jennea (1860,
#   Zaldimar Wefhellt in Goldshire) and Mirror Lake (1861): a Stormwind stop
#   and the Mirror Lake waterfall on the way to Westfall; handed in at the
#   Stormwind stop of 02-westfall (Ley Staff or Ley Orb).
# - Rogue: their level 10 quests reward items, not spells: not taken.
#   Rogues: see the Class guide Blade of Cunning (Alliance).
# - Level 1 class letters are taken: every class's letter from Marshal
#   McBride (3100-3105, 92479) is taken once Kobold Camp Cleanup is handed
#   in and goes to its trainer in the Abbey after Echo Ridge Mine, with the
#   next train, so the trainer visit has something to learn.
# Train at the Abbey and in Goldshire.
# Left out: An Enchanting Lesson (91753, it needs Enchanting to disenchant
# the effigies). Rare Books (91777, after Book Return) wants two books from
# the Jasperlode Mine taken to Brother Paxton in Northshire, off the route.
# Elmpaw's Head (91746) starts from the head of Elmpaw, a named elite that
# roams north-east Elwynn, off the route. The simulator's Stormwind stop at
# 6 is for Jennea Cannon's book quests (84397, 84398, 84399, 84402: each
# needs a book that has no known source, and Wowhead lists them at level 60)
# and three level 2 deliveries (332, 333, 334): not worth the walk without
# the books.

