# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south: Fargodeep and the farms

step Maybell Maclure
  tip Follow the road south out of Goldshire to the Maclure Vineyards. Maybell waits by the house.
  accept 106

step The Fargodeep Mine
  tip The mine is west of the vineyards. Kobold Miners and Tunnelers fill both levels; Nimsy, a named kobold, holds the picture book in the lower tunnels. Nimsy is elite: grouping up is advised.
  complete 62 @40.6,82.3                      -- Walk through the mine
  collect 773 quest 47                        -- Gold Dust
  collect 772 quest 60                        -- Large Candles
  collect 248001 quest 91775 optional         -- Lost Books: Kobold Miners and Tunnelers
  collect 248002 quest 91775 optional         -- Fun with Elementals: Nimsy

step Bait ingredients
  tip Overgrown Duskweed grows in the fields around the vineyards and the Stonefield farm; Stonetusk Boars around them give the blood.
  collect 286214 quest 99130                  -- Duskweed Petal
  collect 286215 quest 99130                  -- Vial of Animal Blood: Stonetusk Boars

step The Stonefield Farm
  tip The Stonefield farm is west of the mine. Ma and "Auntie" Bernice stand by the house.
  accept 88                                   -- Ma Stonefield
  accept 85                                   -- "Auntie" Bernice Stonefield

