# Goldtooth (41.71,78.03) is inside the Fargodeep Mine, under the hill: "He
# was always INSIDE the mine, in the back, on the ground level. Stay leftish"
# (https://www.wowhead.com/forever/npc=327, comments, 2026); "Enter mine 39 82
# and go to 41 78 to kill him" and "Don't go up the stairs for Goldtooth!"
# (https://www.wowhead.com/classic/quest=87, comments); "Enter is on 39 83"
# (https://www.wowhead.com/classic/quest=62, comments). The mouth, 39.5,82.4,
# lies between the Kobold Tunnelers outside it (39.33,83.2, 39.6,82.13) and
# the Kobold Miners inside (39.85,81.06 on). From Billy a straight line to
# Goldtooth climbs the hill above the mine, so the step ends at the mouth.
step Billy Maclure
  turnin 84
  accept 87
  goto 39.5,82.4 "Fargodeep Mine"

step Goldtooth
  tip Goldtooth is inside the Fargodeep Mine, not on the hill above it: go in at the mouth and keep left to the back of the mine floor; don't take the stairs up. Defias Bandits around the vineyards drop a Westfall Deed now and then: right-click it.
  collect 981 quest 87                        -- Bernice's Necklace
  collect 1972 x1 optional                    -- Westfall Deed
  accept 184 optional

