step Jennea Cannon
  only Mage
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Follow the road north from Goldshire into Stormwind. Jennea Cannon stands in the Wizard's Sanctum, the tower of the Mage Quarter; she gives you a flask for the Mirror Lake waterfall.
